 Limited was founded in 1939 and is based in Mumbai, India.","employees":1729,"earnDates":[],"exDiv":null,"asOf":1795529348},"analyst":null,"cap":"Other","caFix":null,"fetched":1795529348,"source":"Yahoo Finance (public chart, fundamentals-timeseries & quoteSummary endpoints)","news":{"q":"\"Godavari Biorefineries\" when:90d","items":[{"t":"Godavari Biorefineries Share Price Target 2027 2028 and 2030","s":"Univest","d":1795458473,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiAFBVV95cUxPbGtnRkgyeHZHUExJdVIzdGk2VERRdno0bTNSNUo2NUVTQ0RqLU5DdnhrZ1VneVRkbHNabmI5SHFxQ1dYa01GcVBXbGFROEJIVXdDUVplaFN2c3FxcDVncW9FVGg1TW04ejRHV1FWc1NHdlF3SktKNTFFOHlQWFRXM19feGFqY0tz?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"Godavari Biorefineries Ltd Technical Momentum Shifts Amid Continued Downtrend","s":"MarketsMojo","d":1794969449,"u":"https://news.google.?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"Godavari Biorefineries posts ₹10.9 crore EBITDA in Q2FY27 on chemical growth","s":"scanx.trade","d":1794632580,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxPQTFSalhsS09WUGZuZTE3WURfbG1jTTRkN0szVFUxa215MnY0UmJOMjF6SC1fTXNBZVltY3ExVmNqaEhkMGJCRnZrTjU5V2RkZFV0eDFKRmdENkh5My1wNlczVHlkYldkR01pamQyUV9ZVU5RWHlIYnJYWGNVbExpSmw4WDV6UUp1TEk5VXhMakM5a3gydEdyemRNQjFVcWVSMGpTR0NNNVl6OEZpOWVGdkZIekJXMzhteGZHODdldkJJNWtE?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"Godavari expects higher sugar output and prices this year","s":"Multibagg AI","d":1794569573,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxOb3d4RmlOOWRRWXZpU2RrR0lFMFBnbnlKNDFibVI1bVhuOXFtY3hRVjBJQ0RhbEcyQlZ2UTFFX2JNOGlFa2UzQW1RR2t2X0VaN01fU2JpTlphU3hIV2FtamJqV0gyOHNlMG96UjRMSHlGRVBmaDZvcXBvem9XX2VNUy0tNWdNMmpodVY4QzBXeDVERVVETlc1SFJBUEt0WFh5R3RUdWl1WWtvSDlNYTQtOEJLcDh2b2tzTjhLOHByZw?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"Godavari Biorefineries targets Rs 240 crore after Q2 beat","s":"Multibagg AI","d":1794569568,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiywFBVV95cUxOV2txd0tORXRhaDY1X2U2TjdYYmkybW9XNDZFalZZRTd1MjUwcXctUmpTNGFCQm5MNlE4MGtGbDFocDItUmZFc1lZcXFVQlp4WUJrRkM1TFlKNUlWYkpMUjlBaFhrMENpM1g4QUhzTE1XeVBMR1